{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23092","headline":"发白狗峡次黄牛峡登高寺却望忠州 · 白居易","name":"发白狗峡次黄牛峡登高寺却望忠州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白狗次黄牛，滩如竹节稠。\n路穿天地险，人续古今愁。\n忽见千花塔，因停一叶舟。\n畏途常迫促，静境暂淹留。\n巴曲春全尽，巫阳雨半收。\n北归虽引领，南望亦回头。\n昔去悲殊俗，今来念旧游。\n别僧山北寺，抛竹水西楼。\n郡树花如雪，军厨酒似油。\n时时大开口，自笑忆忠州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}